    "question": "A conical pendulum has a thread length of $1.5\\ \\mathrm{m}$, and the thread makes the angle $25^\\circ$ with the vertical. Calculate the period. ($g = 9.82\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}$)\n\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420.0 247.8\" style=\"max-width:420px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:16px auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(15,22,32,0.12);border-radius:6px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"263\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"121\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"133\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"126\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"157\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"169\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"162\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"181\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"174\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"193\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"205\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"217\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"229\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"222\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"241\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"234\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"253\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"189\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"189\" y2=\"188.6\" stroke=\"#8a8579\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><path d=\"M 115.0 188.6 A 74.0 19.2 0 0 0 263.0 188.6\" stroke=\"#8a8579\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><path d=\"M 115.0 188.6 A 74.0 19.2 0 0 1 263.0 188.6\" stroke=\"#8a8579\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"189\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"263.0\" y2=\"188.6\" stroke=\"#0f1620\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#0f1620\"/><path d=\"M 201.7 57.2 A 30 30 0 0 1 189.0 60.0\" stroke=\"#8a8579\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"198.3\" y=\"72.0\" font-family=\"Poppins,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#8a8579\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke\">25°</text><text x=\"222.9\" y=\"122.0\" font-family=\"Poppins,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0f1620\" text-anchor=\"end\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><tspan font-style=\"italic\">l</tspan> = 1.5 m</text><circle cx=\"263.0\" cy=\"188.6\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0f1620\"/><text x=\"278.0\" y=\"188.6\" font-family=\"Poppins,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0f1620\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><tspan font-style=\"italic\">m</tspan></text></svg>",
    "answer": {
     "value": 2.3,
     "unit": "s"
    },
    "solution": "We use the formula for the period of the conical pendulum:\n\n$$ T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{l \\cdot \\cos\\alpha}{g}} $$\n\nGiven values:\n$$\n\\left[ \\begin{array}{l}\nl = 1.5\\ \\mathrm{m} \\\\\n\\alpha = 25^\\circ \\\\\ng \\approx 9.82\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\n\\end{array} \\right]\n$$\n\n$$ T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{1.5 \\cdot \\cos 25^\\circ}{9.82}} = 2.3\\ \\mathrm{s} $$\n\n**Answer:** The period is about $2.3\\ \\mathrm{s}$.\n\n**General conclusion:** In a conical pendulum the weight sweeps round in a horizontal circle while the thread forms a cone. Note that the mass does not appear in the formula."
